# FULL MASSIVE AUDIT — every user message

Coordinator posts in this chat → you run the **complete** audit **before** any answer, handoff, or advice. Not optional. Not "unless urgent."

## You are lying if you say

- "You wanted a quick fix" — **never** say this unless coordinator literally typed those words
- "Probably / might be" in a handoff — use log line numbers or mark **unverified**
- "PASS" without quoted log lines
- "I ran SKILL.md" without a wiring table + structural findings section in the same reply
- "I ran Grok" without sources + reference-mod match in the same reply

## Ship intake fast path (BUILDER SHIP HANDOFF pasted)

If message contains `BUILDER SHIP HANDOFF` / `SHIPPED VERSION:` → follow **`auditor-builder-ship-intake.mdc`** first. **No MegaLens** unless FAIL streak ≥ 3 + user approved spend.

## Mandatory order (every other message — no skips)

1. **Read disk** (if applicable to the message):
   - `quest_tracker_log.txt` (tail + grep)
   - `re2_framework_log.txt` (if crash/exit/hang/Lua error)
   - `quest_tracker_prefs.json`, `last_layout.json`, `permanent_layout.json` if layout/prefs topic
   - Screenshots if attached
2. **grok_search** — when message touches REFramework / ImGui / SDK / shutdown / hooks / layout / perf / DD2 modding patterns. One focused query minimum.
3. **OTHERMODS/SKILL.md** — full thermo-nuclear + DD2 addendum checklist every time.
4. **Static grep** — wiring, install order, one plugins.install, ctx, reload guards, file line counts.
5. **Verdict** — PASS or FAIL per item with log proof.

## Every reply must include these sections (use headers)

### LOG PROOF
Quoted lines with file + line number. "No new session" is valid proof if log unchanged.

### GROK
- Top sources (URLs)
- Match vs ModTemplate / ferrystones_vanilla_plus / enemy_nameplates: yes/no + which file
- Or **unverified** + why Grok was skipped (only if message is pure coordinator workflow, zero API/code)

### SKILL.md NUCLEAR
- Wiring checklist table (pass/fail)
- File-size fails (>1k lines)
- ≥1 structural finding (spaghetti, abstraction leak, special-case growth) OR explicit "no new structural debt this session"

### VERDICT
PASS / FAIL table. Behavioral P0/P1 with file:line when FAIL.

### BUILDER HANDOFF
Only if FAIL items exist. P0/P1 only. Log proof per item. **Auditor does not edit files** (`auditor-no-edits.mdc`).

